@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - Parental Control</PageTitle>

<div class="page-container">
    <div class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">ℹ️ About</h1>
        <div class="header-actions">
            <a href="/" class="btn" style="background: #6b7280; color: white;">← Dashboard</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
        <div class="about-section">
            <h2>Parental Control System</h2>
            <p><strong>Version:</strong> 1.30.0</p>
            <p>A centralized parental control system for Linux and Windows with time tracking, enforcement, and web-based administration.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
            <h3>Features</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>✅ Centralized time management across multiple computers</li>
                <li>✅ Cross-platform support (Linux and Windows)</li>
                <li>✅ Time limits shared across all devices</li>
                <li>✅ Per-day and weekly time limits</li>
                <li>✅ Automatic enforcement (logout/lock)</li>
                <li>✅ Real-time usage tracking</li>
                <li>✅ User aliases for multiple accounts</li>
                <li>✅ Native UI for each platform</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
            <h3>Technology Stack</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Backend:</strong> ASP.NET Core 8 with Blazor Server</li>
                <li><strong>Database:</strong> PostgreSQL 16+</li>
                <li><strong>Client:</strong> .NET 8 Worker Service</li>
                <li><strong>UI:</strong> Avalonia (Linux) and WPF (Windows)</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
            <h3>License</h3>
            <p>This project is open source. See the repository for license details.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-section">
            <h3>Source Code</h3>
            <p>
                <a href="https://github.com/crowndip/timekeeper-net" target="_blank" class="btn" style="background: #333; color: white; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;">
                    📦 View on GitHub
                </a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
